                      class="image-with-text__heading inline-richtext h1"
                      
                    >
                      Natural Whey Protein Certified by Cologne List
                    </h2><div
                      class="image-with-text__text rte body"
                      
                    >
                      <p>We have promised our customers that we keep their health and safety above everything. We have left no stone unturned to keep this promise and got another whey protein certification. You will be happy to know that <a href="/collections/all" title="All products">NATURALTEIN </a>is India’s first and only product with a Cologne List certification.</p>
